WEBVTT

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:11.144
Love, Just on my love

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:17.484
I want to protect you with these hands

00:00:27.661 --> 00:00:31.765
Do you know real men?

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:35.903
They're weak to the women they protect

00:00:35.903 --> 00:00:40.107
Is he sweeter than me?

00:00:40.107 --> 00:00:44.211
Is he stronger than me?

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:50.984
The night of the full moon is cold

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:53.887
My soul is supposed to be in my hands

00:00:54.788 --> 00:01:03.263
My memories get moved to the shadows

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:07.334
Love, Just on my love

00:01:07.334 --> 00:01:13.373
I want to protect you with these hands

00:01:13.674 --> 00:01:21.949
You taught me about women, love, and passion

00:01:30.324 --> 00:01:33.660
I'm Orphen, a black sorcerer
from the Tower of Fangs.

00:01:33.961 --> 00:01:37.397
Five years ago, the magician
| looked up to, Azalie,

00:01:37.397 --> 00:01:41.001
activated the Heavenly Beings'
Sword of Baltanders

00:01:41.001 --> 00:01:44.004
and became the magical beast Bloody August.

00:01:45.038 --> 00:01:47.641
After leaving the Tower of Fangs
in search of Azalie,

00:01:47.641 --> 00:01:50.611
I, with my apprentice Majic and Cleao,

00:01:50.611 --> 00:01:53.947
began a quest to restore Azalie
to her normal human state.

00:01:54.348 --> 00:01:56.416
Let's go Majic! Cleao!

00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:57.751
To our next adventure!

00:01:57.751 --> 00:01:59.086
To the next town!

00:02:22.275 --> 00:02:23.910
It's so peaceful!

00:02:24.745 --> 00:02:29.983
I think if we could rest here for a while
it would cleanse our lives.

00:02:29.983 --> 00:02:32.586
| bet our souls would be cleansed too!

00:02:32.586 --> 00:02:33.887
Right?

00:02:36.256 --> 00:02:39.259
The sun is shining so warmly!
It feels so good!

00:02:39.693 --> 00:02:43.196
| bet it'd feel so good
if I took a nap around here.

00:02:45.599 --> 00:02:47.634
Enough already, you two!

00:02:48.101 --> 00:02:51.204
How many times do you have to rest anyway?!

00:02:52.239 --> 00:02:53.340
So what?

00:03:31.611 --> 00:03:33.880
Hey, Maris, working hard?

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:35.849
Isn't your mother coming home today?

00:03:35.849 --> 00:03:36.750
Yes!

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:40.687
That so? Then take a lot of milk
home with you later, okay?

00:03:40.687 --> 00:03:42.122
Thank you very much!

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:20.594
Orphen, you just don't relax!

00:04:21.094 --> 00:04:22.596
Did you say something?

00:04:23.029 --> 00:04:25.565
My late father always said,
"If you rush through life too fast,

00:04:25.565 --> 00:04:28.535
you only rush towards
an early death!" So, there!

00:04:30.971 --> 00:04:32.472
Anyway...

00:04:37.144 --> 00:04:38.645
What's wrong?

00:04:38.845 --> 00:04:41.081
Leki's not here.

00:04:42.883 --> 00:04:45.218
I'm sure he was here a moment ago.

00:04:45.218 --> 00:04:48.221
Leki, where are you?

00:04:48.955 --> 00:04:50.624
Leki!

00:04:51.224 --> 00:04:53.460
You don't think he got separated from us?

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:55.529
S-separated?

00:04:56.096 --> 00:04:58.965
Hey, don't just stand there!

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.502
Hey, Leki!

00:05:03.203 --> 00:05:05.105
You have to be kidding.

00:05:05.105 --> 00:05:08.542
What do you think will happen if you
let such a dangerous guy loose?

00:05:09.075 --> 00:05:10.677
Leki!

00:05:10.977 --> 00:05:11.978
Leki!

00:05:11.978 --> 00:05:12.479
Leki!
Leki!

00:05:12.479 --> 00:05:12.913
Leki!

00:05:12.913 --> 00:05:18.919
Leki's small adventure

00:05:20.253 --> 00:05:21.588
Thank you for the food!

00:05:23.423 --> 00:05:25.192
Say, Big Brother Maris,

00:05:25.192 --> 00:05:28.328
do you think Mama's really gonna
come home today?

00:05:28.628 --> 00:05:30.096
Of course!

00:05:30.096 --> 00:05:31.331
Really?!

00:05:31.631 --> 00:05:35.635
She said that she'd come home from
Dekasugi on your birthday, right?

00:05:38.438 --> 00:05:41.541
And she will bring you a present,
just as she promised!

00:05:41.541 --> 00:05:43.076
I'm so glad!

00:05:44.077 --> 00:05:45.946
Big Brother, where're you going?

00:05:46.646 --> 00:05:49.349
Isn't it still early for your afternoon job?

00:05:49.349 --> 00:05:50.684
I'll be back soon!

00:06:02.462 --> 00:06:06.466
With this I'll buy a present and surprise Lulu!

00:06:16.776 --> 00:06:18.144
Don't come up!

00:06:18.144 --> 00:06:19.679
Stay in there!

00:06:19.679 --> 00:06:21.181
Go away!

00:06:21.681 --> 00:06:23.049
What are you doing?

00:06:23.049 --> 00:06:24.150
Oh, it's just you, Maris.

00:06:25.151 --> 00:06:28.688
He was trying to get out of the river,
so we're beating him up.

00:06:29.589 --> 00:06:32.092
Quit it. Don't you feel sorry for it?!

00:06:32.359 --> 00:06:34.194
Don't you know?

00:06:34.194 --> 00:06:36.363
Lately packs of wild dogs
have been attacking people

00:06:36.363 --> 00:06:38.131
and everybody's scared, you know!

00:06:38.131 --> 00:06:41.034
But that has nothing to do with
that little one, right?

00:06:42.702 --> 00:06:44.804
Bunch of bullies picking on a weak thing.

00:06:46.806 --> 00:06:48.642
Don't preach at me!

00:06:48.642 --> 00:06:50.810
This isn't any fun! Let's go!

00:06:57.717 --> 00:06:59.452
Are you all right?

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:01.821
That tickles!

00:07:02.522 --> 00:07:05.558
Oh, do you have an owner?

00:07:06.393 --> 00:07:09.496
It'd be bad if someone found you,
so come with me, okay?

00:07:18.138 --> 00:07:20.640
Starving... I'm starving...

00:07:20.640 --> 00:07:24.377
Why does My Greatness
have to suffer such feelings?

00:07:28.949 --> 00:07:32.919
It's because you took all the money we had
and bought that weird rock.

00:07:32.919 --> 00:07:34.621
What are you saying?!

00:07:34.621 --> 00:07:38.358
All you have to do is have it
and it makes you rich.

00:07:38.358 --> 00:07:41.962
A truly thanks-inspiring treasure!

00:07:43.530 --> 00:07:46.666
There's no way that's true.

00:07:47.367 --> 00:07:49.703
So you think so after all, Dortin?

00:07:49.703 --> 00:07:52.605
That's right, Big Brother. You were deceived.

00:07:57.811 --> 00:08:00.947
| guess it means we have to find
honest work, right, Big Brother?

00:08:08.989 --> 00:08:11.257
You, you! Yes, you little boy.

00:08:17.797 --> 00:08:19.766
Wow! It's cute!

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:22.702
| saved him by the river.

00:08:23.436 --> 00:08:25.939
Big Brother, can we keep him?

00:08:25.939 --> 00:08:29.943
Sorry, but I think he probably has an owner.

00:08:29.943 --> 00:08:32.145
See, he's wearing an expensive collar.

00:08:32.145 --> 00:08:34.814
Oh, then he's just lost?

00:08:35.315 --> 00:08:38.318
This guy is a guest here for today's party!

00:08:39.919 --> 00:08:41.621
Welcome, Doggie!

00:08:41.621 --> 00:08:44.457
Oh yeah, I'll give Doggie some milk.

00:08:49.829 --> 00:08:51.031
Lulu!

00:08:51.031 --> 00:08:52.265
What?

00:08:53.633 --> 00:08:55.635
Happy birthday!

00:08:57.670 --> 00:08:59.973
Wow! What a pretty gem!

00:09:00.173 --> 00:09:03.376
This will grant you
whatever you want just once!

00:09:03.376 --> 00:09:05.378
They said it's a Gemstone of Happiness.

00:09:05.812 --> 00:09:08.181
Wow! Thank you, Big Brother!

00:09:08.548 --> 00:09:11.084
Now, go on! Ask it for whatever you want!

00:09:11.384 --> 00:09:12.385
Okay.

00:09:14.721 --> 00:09:18.124
Please let Mommy come home soon.

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:31.404
Easy! So easy!
Did you see My Greatness' talent?

00:09:34.541 --> 00:09:38.044
You deceived that poor kid!
What Gemstone of Happiness?

00:09:38.511 --> 00:09:40.146
What are you saying?!

00:09:40.146 --> 00:09:45.151
For just one silver coin I sold that child hope!

00:09:45.418 --> 00:09:48.521
But don't you call that fraud?

00:09:49.022 --> 00:09:52.625
What happened was the perfect result
of supply and demand.

00:09:58.598 --> 00:09:59.799
It's an emergency!

00:10:01.601 --> 00:10:03.036
What's happened?

00:10:03.036 --> 00:10:07.474
Earlier, I was chased by wild dogs,
and fell from the cliff.

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:15.148
This is bad!

00:10:15.148 --> 00:10:17.016
What are you doing, Dortin?

00:10:17.684 --> 00:10:20.320
We have to tend to her, Big Brother!

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:22.188
What are you saying?

00:10:22.188 --> 00:10:24.791
What good is it to do something
that won't make any money?

00:10:34.767 --> 00:10:39.305
Stop dawdling, Dortin!
We must hurry to rescue the lady!

00:10:40.106 --> 00:10:41.241
You can't...

00:10:42.809 --> 00:10:44.244
I'm so sorry.

00:10:44.244 --> 00:10:45.612
Think nothing of it.

00:10:45.612 --> 00:10:47.881
As they say, "If you see the
honorable thing to do and don't do it,

00:10:47.881 --> 00:10:49.716
then you have no true courage."

00:10:52.785 --> 00:10:54.888
Your plan's so blatantly obvious.

00:11:00.226 --> 00:11:02.729
And how are you feeling, Madam?

00:11:03.129 --> 00:11:05.298
Thank you so much.

00:11:05.298 --> 00:11:06.833
I'm already fine.

00:11:08.434 --> 00:11:10.837
You can't, not with that leg.

00:11:13.873 --> 00:11:15.542
What should I do?

00:11:15.542 --> 00:11:17.410
| have to get home quickly.

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:19.279
The children are waiting.

00:11:19.779 --> 00:11:22.315
Oh, Maris! Lulu!

00:11:22.315 --> 00:11:25.285
Well then! If such is the case,

00:11:25.285 --> 00:11:29.255
then I shall endeavor to fetch some
pain-killing herbs just for Madam.

00:11:29.989 --> 00:11:33.059
What with this and that, I'm sorry
to keep causing you trouble.

00:11:33.593 --> 00:11:36.596
Oh, that's okay. We don't need
a reward or anything.

00:11:38.598 --> 00:11:40.433
That's why I said you're so obvious.

00:12:04.524 --> 00:12:07.927
I'm going to get ready for the party,
so you help me too, okay, Doggie?

00:12:22.642 --> 00:12:25.278
| wish we had a pretty tablecloth.

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:38.758
This'll do it!

00:12:46.065 --> 00:12:48.568
No! If you fall, you'll get burned!

00:12:49.202 --> 00:12:51.638
Now, finally the cake's next!

00:12:57.510 --> 00:12:59.646
The two-layer cake is done!

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:02.582
But maybe it's looking a little lonely?

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:09.622
Now it looks like a real cake!

00:13:09.622 --> 00:13:11.157
Thank you, Doggie!

00:13:18.898 --> 00:13:22.268
| wish Mommy would come home soon.

00:13:40.019 --> 00:13:41.688
What are you doing?

00:13:42.488 --> 00:13:44.924
It's the idiot sorcerer and and his two friends!

00:13:44.924 --> 00:13:47.060
Destroying nature this time?

00:13:47.527 --> 00:13:50.430
| didn't think even you could fall so low.

00:13:50.730 --> 00:13:52.298
What are you saying?

00:13:52.298 --> 00:13:55.768
| am on a mission of supreme importance,
rescuing a woman hurt by wild dogs,

00:13:55.768 --> 00:13:57.770
and as you can see-

00:14:00.206 --> 00:14:01.808
Dogs, you say?

00:14:02.275 --> 00:14:04.711
That could be Leki, you know.

00:14:04.711 --> 00:14:05.778
Why?

00:14:06.479 --> 00:14:08.781
After all he is a ferocious beast.

00:14:08.781 --> 00:14:13.052
How rude! Leki would never
assault people without reason!

00:14:13.052 --> 00:14:14.454
You never know.

00:14:14.454 --> 00:14:17.924
You're
wrong!

00:14:35.942 --> 00:14:37.276
I'm ho me!

00:14:43.149 --> 00:14:44.751
What's wrong, Lulu?

00:14:45.151 --> 00:14:47.987
Mommy hasn't come home yet.

00:14:48.588 --> 00:14:52.091
It's all right. She'll be home soon.

00:14:53.393 --> 00:14:57.563
Maybe she forgot Lulu's birthday.

00:14:57.997 --> 00:15:00.500
There's no way that could happen!

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.001
But...

00:15:02.001 --> 00:15:05.571
But didn't you ask the
Gemstone of Happiness?

00:15:09.008 --> 00:15:12.345
| wonder if Mommy got lost?

00:15:13.346 --> 00:15:16.115
Okay! Then let's go meet her!

00:15:20.453 --> 00:15:24.056
Maybe something happened to Mother.

00:15:27.794 --> 00:15:30.196
Heal that which is mine,
Spirit of Healing Light.

00:15:37.270 --> 00:15:38.905
| can't believe it!

00:15:38.905 --> 00:15:41.340
The pain was gone before I could say, "Ah?!"

00:15:41.741 --> 00:15:44.043
Thank you so very much!

00:15:44.444 --> 00:15:48.114
It's nothing. Nothing.
It wasn't really anything.

00:15:49.048 --> 00:15:51.317
It's not like you healed her, right, Big Brother?

00:15:51.717 --> 00:15:55.955
But I was the one who
brought the sorcerer here.

00:15:55.955 --> 00:15:59.459
And I was the one who
brought the herbs too.

00:15:59.892 --> 00:16:02.128
You just cut the first tree you saw.

00:16:02.128 --> 00:16:04.964
But I do not seek a reward.

00:16:04.964 --> 00:16:08.434
As thanks, that thing in the bag...

00:16:10.303 --> 00:16:12.705
See, it was just like I said after all!

00:16:12.705 --> 00:16:14.907
It wasn't Leki!

00:16:14.907 --> 00:16:16.042
Well, yeah.

00:16:16.642 --> 00:16:19.245
But now we don't have any leads, do we?

00:16:20.179 --> 00:16:23.082
Thank you so very much!

00:16:23.483 --> 00:16:28.421
| have to hurry home because
I think my children are worried.

00:16:29.222 --> 00:16:31.390
If that should be the case,
| worry about the wild dogs.

00:16:31.390 --> 00:16:33.659
| shall see you to your home.

00:16:34.694 --> 00:16:37.330
But I can't be spoiled by you.

00:16:37.697 --> 00:16:40.500
Do they not say,
"I have already boarded the ship?"

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:43.102
Please don't concern yourself. Let us go.

00:16:43.769 --> 00:16:46.372
Big Brother still hasn't given up?

00:16:55.381 --> 00:16:59.185
You, how far are you planning to follow me?!

00:16:59.485 --> 00:17:02.522
We're just looking for Leki.

00:17:02.522 --> 00:17:05.791
This is the only direction
we haven't searched yet.

00:17:06.492 --> 00:17:11.531
Damn... Has anything ever gone
according to the plan with them around?

00:17:11.898 --> 00:17:14.600
Plan? So you actually have plans, Big Brother?

00:17:14.867 --> 00:17:17.870
On the way we'll steal the box,
and then run as fast as we can.

00:17:18.271 --> 00:17:19.272
Big Brother...

00:17:19.272 --> 00:17:20.306
It's perfect!

00:17:25.444 --> 00:17:28.648
Mother's probably already made it
to somewhere around here.

00:17:28.848 --> 00:17:29.849
Really?

00:17:29.849 --> 00:17:31.651
It's only common sense, isn't it?

00:17:44.864 --> 00:17:46.265
It's the wild dogs!

00:17:49.135 --> 00:17:50.436
Big Brother!

00:17:50.436 --> 00:17:53.739
Don't speak. We can't provoke them.

00:18:04.684 --> 00:18:06.385
No! I'm scared!

00:18:10.389 --> 00:18:11.424
What's that?

00:18:11.657 --> 00:18:12.925
It's Lulu's voice!

00:18:15.728 --> 00:18:17.296
Lulu! Maris!

00:18:17.663 --> 00:18:19.465
Madam, where are you off to?!

00:18:37.984 --> 00:18:40.019
You're okay then, the both of you?!

00:18:40.019 --> 00:18:41.487
Mommy!

00:18:42.288 --> 00:18:44.190
Mommy!

00:18:45.358 --> 00:18:46.692
Watch out, Lulu!

00:18:48.494 --> 00:18:49.595
Lulu!

00:18:55.735 --> 00:18:57.436
Her bags!

00:18:59.505 --> 00:19:01.340
Sword of Light, whom I do-

00:19:03.409 --> 00:19:05.878
| can't. I don't have a good shot.

00:19:39.679 --> 00:19:42.081
He is ferocious after all.

00:19:42.348 --> 00:19:44.350
Leki!

00:19:47.420 --> 00:19:49.922
Geez, we've been looking for you!

00:19:54.060 --> 00:19:56.562
Mommy! Mommy!

00:19:57.363 --> 00:19:59.231
I'm so glad you're all right.

00:19:59.465 --> 00:20:01.600
We came to meet you.

00:20:01.867 --> 00:20:03.803
I'm so sorry. I was delayed.

00:20:12.344 --> 00:20:15.047
Isn't it great that we found Leki too?

00:20:18.184 --> 00:20:21.721
That reminds me, it seemed
like you knew those kids.

00:20:23.656 --> 00:20:28.027
Didn't that kid say something like,
"Thank you for the gemstone?"

00:20:29.829 --> 00:20:32.798
It just happened that I had a pretty little stone

00:20:32.798 --> 00:20:35.801
and so I gave it to a passing youth.

00:20:36.135 --> 00:20:39.105
| guess it looks like a gemstone to kids, right?

00:20:41.107 --> 00:20:42.908
What're you doing?! You!

00:20:46.245 --> 00:20:48.547
The silver coin I scammed from that kid!

00:20:48.547 --> 00:20:50.316
Oh, is that so?

00:20:51.317 --> 00:20:53.986
| thought it'd be something like that.

00:20:57.757 --> 00:20:59.258
Leki!

00:20:59.658 --> 00:21:01.527
| won't do it again!
| won't do it again!

00:21:01.527 --> 00:21:03.129
Why me too?

00:21:08.601 --> 00:21:11.504
See? This is the Gemstone of Happiness.

00:21:11.804 --> 00:21:13.572
Thank you Lulu.

00:21:13.773 --> 00:21:19.245
Because you made the wish
| was able to come home safely.

00:21:20.112 --> 00:21:23.015
It was a present from Big Brother.

00:21:25.251 --> 00:21:27.753
And here's one from Mommy.

00:21:28.053 --> 00:21:30.156
Wow! Thank you!

00:21:37.930 --> 00:21:41.033
What a pretty jewelry box. I'm so happy!

00:21:56.015 --> 00:21:57.516
This is...

00:22:01.320 --> 00:22:02.988
Oh, Doggie!

00:22:03.556 --> 00:22:06.959
Bye-bye, Doggie!

00:22:13.933 --> 00:22:18.771
Headed toward the Tower of Fangs,
we come upon a ruined and uninhabited village.

00:22:19.805 --> 00:22:21.607
What are you?

00:22:21.607 --> 00:22:23.375
"Black Tiger" you say?

00:22:23.676 --> 00:22:27.012
| don't have any time to fight with
an unknown entity like you!

00:22:27.379 --> 00:22:31.483
The ones we have to fight are
the ones that destroyed the village!

00:22:31.884 --> 00:22:33.819
Next time on Sorcerous Stabber Orphen:

00:22:33.819 --> 00:22:35.855
the shrimp man of frlENOShlp
"The Shrimp Man of Friendship."

00:22:35.855 --> 00:22:38.057
The shrimp man of frlENOShlp
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:22:38.057 --> 00:22:38.791
The shrimp man
of frlENOShlp

00:22:49.268 --> 00:22:53.339
You aren't here, the one I really love

00:22:53.339 --> 00:22:57.409
My first love has reached a dead end

00:22:57.877 --> 00:23:06.118
Tonight in my dreams, a smiling you doesn't appear

00:23:06.752 --> 00:23:10.789
Your last lines came out of your lips too soon

00:23:10.789 --> 00:23:14.393
You were troubled by

00:23:15.327 --> 00:23:19.265
Your last lines as soon as your lips said them

00:23:19.265 --> 00:23:23.002
But then you kissed me

00:23:24.069 --> 00:23:28.474
To only my lips

00:23:28.474 --> 00:23:32.678
Please give your warmth

00:23:32.678 --> 00:23:37.049
To only my lips

00:23:37.049 --> 00:23:40.920
Will you always remain

00:23:41.186 --> 00:23:43.656
A gentle you

00:23:43.656 --> 00:23:47.826
To only my lips

00:23:47.826 --> 00:23:52.131
